# This branch is a distribution artifact: it gets cloned onto Windows, macOS and Linux
# alike and served straight to browsers, so pin line endings to LF everywhere rather than
# letting each machine's core.autocrlf decide. The data files are declared binary
# explicitly so no autocrlf setting can ever rewrite bytes inside them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin  binary
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
